{"seq":18,"trial_id":"shared-brain-access-2026-11/claude-code-opus-none-mu-v031-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-22T15:14:55.084Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"a8dd5543a7dcf81c015d9a24c6853276889f87fa3e9d02fda46c7bc8594e6ba6","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Dana, I went through all of Moss's digests in the shared team folders. I found two Quarrendon Freight Lines tickets:\n\n• *#PD-4492*: from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell opened it on 4 Oct 2025 because the Eau Claire gatehouse kiosk wasn't sending SMS bay assignments for Dock Doors 14–18 on the 04:00 shift. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed on 5 Oct that it was fixed. There was also a follow-up to archive the kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n• *#4419*: from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners couldn't read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing.\n\nA few notes:\n• The other QFL digests from 2025-09-14 and 2026-03-23 don't mention any ticket numbers.\n• Tickets #4409, #4412 and FR-882 show up in Moss's Central digests, but they belong to Marrow accounts, not QFL.\n• The cheat sheet says not to confuse QFL with Quarendon Freightways, a non-customer. Marcus's intel note covers that one, so leave it out of the weekly notes.\n• I can't see any of Moss's personal notes files or the QFL account folder, so there could be more tickets I can't check."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
